OL,3,GNEWSAChurch, windmill, and Roman town
OL,4,Aon at-risk list
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grade II listed mid-Victorian church
OL,7,Fhas been added to Historic England's at
OL,8,Frisk register.
OL,10,FHoly Trinity Church in Bridlington,
OL,11,Fbuilt in 1870, was added to the list
OL,12,Fdue to problems including stone
OL,13,Fdeterioration and poor condition of its
OL,14,Fchurch tower.
OL,16,F"There's an active community who use
OL,17,Fthe church and want to keep it in good
OL,18,Forder," said Giles Proctor, an
OL,19,Farchitect at Historic England.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
