OL,3,GNEWSAChurch, windmill, and Roman town
OL,4,Aon at-risk list
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther East Yorkshire sites added to the
OL,7,FHeritage at Risk Register for 2026
OL,8,Finclude Lelley Windmill in Elstronwick,
OL,9,FSt Mary Magdalene Church in Whitgift,
OL,10,Fand the Roman minor town identified as
OL,11,FDerventio, near Stamford Bridge.
